We've encountered the same error and were able to fix it by changing the populate fields:

before
```
{
  dynamic_content: {
    populate: {
      repeatable_component: '*'
      },
    },
  }
}
```

after
```
{
  dynamic_content: {
    populate: {
      repeatable_component: {
        populate: {
          image: '*',
        },
      },
    },
  }
}
```

hope this helps you

I have created a strapi project able to reproduce this bug.

Example query:
`http://localhost:1337/api/articles?populate[testDZ][populate]=*`

