The nested repeatable components are returned when created from a 4.14.0 project from scratch. However the many-to-one relational field `authors` is missing from the response see:

<img width="522" src="https://github.com/strapi/strapi/assets/1625782/36f48e16-12c9-4ce9-8f26-638d342dff5b">

This is also confirmed in my own strapi project that repeatable nested components are working in 4.14.0 but relational fields are no longer being returned.
